{"id":"me_pris","lemma":"mépris","pos":"noun","rank":4668,"glosses":["scorn","contempt, disdain"],"ipa":"/me.pʁi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-m%C3%A9pris.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-m%C3%A9pris.wav.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Il parle toujours du gouvernement avec mépris.","en":"He always speaks of the government with contempt.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"government"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"La familiarité engendre le mépris.","en":"Familiarity breeds contempt.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"familiarity"},{"g":"to generate","l":"engendrer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Ne le regarde pas avec mépris juste parce qu'il est pauvre.","en":"Don't look down on him just because he's poor.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"because"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"poor"}]},{"text":"La familiarité nourrit le mépris et les enfants.","en":"Familiarity breeds contempt and children.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"familiarity"},{"g":"to feed , nourish","l":"nourrir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"}]},{"text":"Il a sauvé la vie de son ami au mépris de la sienne.","en":"He saved his friend at the risk of his own life.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to save, rescue","l":"sauver"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"to the"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[10,12,"of the"]]}]}